#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:2
msgid "与 AgentSociety 交互"
msgstr "Interacting with AgentSociety"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:4
msgid ""
"使用 ``society.ask()`` 查询状态，使用 ``society.intervene()`` 调用写工具，使用 ``step()`` 或 ``run()`` "
"推进模拟时间。初始化流程见 :doc:`quickstart`。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``society.ask()`` to query state, ``society.intervene()`` to call write tools, "
"and ``step()`` or ``run()`` to advance simulation time. See :doc:`quickstart` for "
"initialization."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:7
msgid "交互入口"
msgstr "Interaction Entry Points"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:9
msgid "查询使用只读工具，干预可以调用写工具"
msgstr "Queries use read-only tools; interventions can call write tools"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:53
msgid "查询、修改与推进"
msgstr "Query, Modify and Advance"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:55
msgid "下面使用内置天气环境演示完整调用顺序："
msgstr "The built-in weather environment demonstrates the complete call sequence:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"from datetime import datetime\n"
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"\n"
"from agentsociety2.contrib.env import WeatherEnvironment\n"
"from agentsociety2.env import CodeGenRouter\n"
"from agentsociety2.society import AgentSociety\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    society = AgentSociety(\n"
"        agent_specs=[{\"id\": 1, \"profile\": {\"name\": \"Demo Agent\"}, \"config\": {}}],\n"
"        agent_class_name=\"PersonAgent\",\n"
"        env_router=CodeGenRouter(env_modules=[WeatherEnvironment()]),\n"
"        start_t=datetime(2026, 1, 1),\n"
"        run_dir=Path(\"run\"),\n"
"    )\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await society.init()\n"
"        print(await society.ask(\"What is the current weather?\"))\n"
"        print(await society.intervene(\"Change the weather to rainy at 15 degrees Celsius\"))\n"
"        print(await society.ask(\"What is the current weather now?\"))\n"
"        await society.run(num_steps=2, tick=600)\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        await society.close()\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"from datetime import datetime\n"
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"\n"
"from agentsociety2.contrib.env import WeatherEnvironment\n"
"from agentsociety2.env import CodeGenRouter\n"
"from agentsociety2.society import AgentSociety\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    society = AgentSociety(\n"
"        agent_specs=[{\"id\": 1, \"profile\": {\"name\": \"Demo Agent\"}, \"config\": {}}],\n"
"        agent_class_name=\"PersonAgent\",\n"
"        env_router=CodeGenRouter(env_modules=[WeatherEnvironment()]),\n"
"        start_t=datetime(2026, 1, 1),\n"
"        run_dir=Path(\"run\"),\n"
"    )\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await society.init()\n"
"        print(await society.ask(\"What is the current weather?\"))\n"
"        print(await society.intervene(\"Change the weather to rainy at 15 degrees Celsius\"))\n"
"        print(await society.ask(\"What is the current weather now?\"))\n"
"        await society.run(num_steps=2, tick=600)\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        await society.close()\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:86
msgid "``ask`` 使用只读环境工具；``intervene`` 可调用环境公开的写工具。可用操作取决于挂载的模块，工具定义见 :doc:`env_modules`。"
msgstr ""
"``ask`` uses read-only environment tools; ``intervene`` can call write tools exposed "
"by the environment. Available operations depend on mounted modules; see "
":doc:`env_modules` for tool definitions."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:89
msgid "按时间点读取状态"
msgstr "Read State at Time Points"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:91
msgid "在已初始化的 ``society`` 上逐步运行："
msgstr "Advance an initialized ``society`` step by step:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:93
msgid ""
"for step_number in range(3):\n"
"    print(step_number, await society.ask(\"Describe the current environment state\"))\n"
"    await society.step(tick=600)"
msgstr ""
"for step_number in range(3):\n"
"    print(step_number, await society.ask(\"Describe the current environment state\"))\n"
"    await society.step(tick=600)"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:99
msgid "``tick`` 的单位是秒。每步先推进智能体，再推进环境，最后更新模拟时钟；返回值与状态记录可配合查看。"
msgstr ""
"``tick`` is measured in seconds. Each step advances agents, then the environment, "
"then the simulation clock. Inspect returned responses together with recorded state."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:102
msgid "查看输出"
msgstr "View Outputs"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:104
msgid "当前问答结果：读取 ``ask`` / ``intervene`` 的返回值。"
msgstr "Current responses: read the return values of ``ask`` and ``intervene``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:105
msgid "时序状态：使用 ``ReplayReader`` 读取 ``run/replay/``，见 :doc:`storage`。"
msgstr "Time-series state: read ``run/replay/`` with ``ReplayReader``; see :doc:`storage`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:106
msgid "工具与模型调用：查看 ``run/trace/``。"
msgstr "Tool and model calls: inspect ``run/trace/``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:107
msgid "保存问答产物：CLI 的 ``ask`` / ``intervene`` 步骤自动写入 ``run/artifacts/``，见 :doc:`cli`。"
msgstr ""
"Saved responses: CLI ``ask`` / ``intervene`` steps automatically write to "
"``run/artifacts/``; see :doc:`cli`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:109
msgid "更多接口见 :doc:`api/society`；定向查询智能体的方法见 ``AgentSocietyHelper``。"
msgstr ""
"Further interfaces are in :doc:`api/society`; see ``AgentSocietyHelper`` for targeted"
" agent queries."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:112
msgid "结构化问卷"
msgstr "Structured questionnaires"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:114
msgid ""
"需要向多个参与者发放同一组问题时，使用 ``society.run_questionnaire(questionnaire, "
"target_agent_ids=...)``。``Questionnaire`` 指定问卷编号和题目列表，``QuestionnaireResponse`` 保留目标 "
"Agent、原始回答、解析值与解析是否成功等结果；输入与返回类型见 :doc:`api/society`，题目字段见 :doc:`api/config`。"
msgstr ""
"To ask multiple participants the same questions, use "
"``society.run_questionnaire(questionnaire, target_agent_ids=...)``. ``Questionnaire``"
" specifies the questionnaire ID and items. ``QuestionnaireResponse`` preserves target"
" agents, raw answers, parsed values, and parsing status. See :doc:`api/society` for "
"input and result types and :doc:`api/config` for question fields."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/interaction.rst:116
msgid ""
"CLI 的 ``questionnaire`` 步骤会把问卷产物写入 ``run/artifacts/``，适合在模拟的指定时点收集结构化响应，配置方式见 "
":doc:`cli`。直接调用 SDK 时，调用方负责保存返回结果；检查 ``parse_success`` 和原始回答后再汇总指标。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI ``questionnaire`` step writes artifacts to ``run/artifacts/`` for collecting "
"structured responses at specified simulation points; see :doc:`cli` for "
"configuration. With direct SDK calls, save the returned result yourself. Check "
"``parse_success`` and raw answers before aggregating metrics."
